Here is a complete, single-file web app. You can save it as an `index.html` file and open it directly in any browser.

It includes:
- A live **seat counter** (starts at 20).
- A **registration form** with validation.
- A **seat visualization grid** showing taken vs. available seats.
- **Local persistence** using `localStorage` so registrations aren't lost on page refresh.
- Prevention against duplicate emails.

### `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Workshop Registration</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #1e293b;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --success: #16a34a;
      --danger: #dc2626;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .counter-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .counter-badge.sold-out {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    /* Seat Grid Visualization */
    .seats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }

    .seat {
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background-color: #e2e8f0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .seat.taken {
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Form Styles */
    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    input {
      padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    input:focus {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    button {
      padding: 0.75rem;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--primary-hover);
    }

    button:disabled {
      background-color: #cbd5e1;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    /* Messages & Lists */
    .message {
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: none;
    }

    .message.error {
      background-color: #fef2f2;
      color: var(--danger);
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      display: block;
    }

    .message.success {
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      color: var(--success);
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      display: block;
    }

    .attendee-list {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .attendee-list h2 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      max-height: 150px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    li {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <header>
        <h1>Workshop Sign-up</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">Join our exclusive interactive session</p>
        <div id="seatCounter" class="counter-badge">20 seats remaining</div>
      </header>

      <div class="seats-grid" id="seatsGrid"></div>

      <div id="statusMessage" class="message"></div>

      <form id="signupForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Full Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="Jane Doe">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="jane@example.com">
        </div>
        <button type="submit" id="submitBtn">Claim a Seat</button>
      </form>

      <div class="attendee-list">
        <h2>Attendees</h2>
        <ul id="attendees"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const TOTAL_SEATS = 20;

    // Retrieve registered users from LocalStorage or default to empty array
    let attendees = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('workshop_attendees')) || [];

    // DOM Elements
    const form = document.getElementById('signupForm');
    const nameInput = document.getElementById('name');
    const emailInput = document.getElementById('email');
    const seatCounter = document.getElementById('seatCounter');
    const seatsGrid = document.getElementById('seatsGrid');
    const attendeesList = document.getElementById('attendees');
    const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
    const statusMessage = document.getElementById('statusMessage');

    function showMessage(text, type) {
      statusMessage.textContent = text;
      statusMessage.className = `message ${type}`;
      setTimeout(() => {
        statusMessage.className = 'message';
      }, 4000);
    }

    function render() {
      const remainingSeats = TOTAL_SEATS - attendees.length;

      // Update seat counter
      seatCounter.textContent = `${remainingSeats} of ${TOTAL_SEATS} seats remaining`;
      if (remainingSeats === 0) {
        seatCounter.classList.add('sold-out');
        seatCounter.textContent = "Workshop Sold Out";
        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        nameInput.disabled = true;
        emailInput.disabled = true;
      } else {
        seatCounter.classList.remove('sold-out');
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
        nameInput.disabled = false;
        emailInput.disabled = false;
      }

      // Render seat visualization
      seatsGrid.innerHTML = '';
      for (let i = 1; i <= TOTAL_SEATS; i++) {
        const seat = document.createElement('div');
        seat.classList.add('seat');
        if (i <= attendees.length) {
          seat.classList.add('taken');
        }
        seat.textContent = `#${i}`;
        seatsGrid.appendChild(seat);
      }

      // Render attendee list
      attendeesList.innerHTML = '';
      attendees.forEach((att, index) => {
        const li = document.createElement('li');
        li.innerHTML = `<span><strong>Seat ${index + 1}:</strong> ${att.name}</span> <span style="color:var(--text-muted);">${att.email}</span>`;
        attendeesList.appendChild(li);
      });
    }

    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();

      if (attendees.length >= TOTAL_SEATS) {
        showMessage('Sorry, no seats left!', 'error');
        return;
      }

      const name = nameInput.value.trim();
      const email = emailInput.value.trim().toLowerCase();

      // Check for duplicate email
      const isAlreadyRegistered = attendees.some(att => att.email === email);
      if (isAlreadyRegistered) {
        showMessage('This email has already claimed a seat.', 'error');
        return;
      }

      // Register new user
      const newAttendee = { name, email, seatNumber: attendees.length + 1 };
      attendees.push(newAttendee);

      // Save to LocalStorage
      localStorage.setItem('workshop_attendees', JSON.stringify(attendees));

      // Reset form and render UI
      nameInput.value = '';
      emailInput.value = '';
      showMessage(`Success! You have claimed Seat #${newAttendee.seatNumber}.`, 'success');
      render();
    });

    // Initial render on load
    render();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

### How to use it:
1. Save the code into a file named **`index.html`**.
2. Double-click the file to open it in your browser.
3. To reset the seats for testing, open your browser console (<kbd>F12</kbd>) and run: `localStorage.clear(); location.reload();`.

